  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Through debugging (With MediaMTX) VRChat is technically \"in spec\" but is effectively out of spec for RTSP streams:\n\nMost RTSP clients, including VLC, send the keep-alive at least a few seconds before the server requires it\n\nMy MediaMTX server is sending a 60 second timeout in the RTSP header, and correctly dropping the connection because it is not receiving the keep-alive trigger within those 60 seconds.  VRChat should send this keep-alive at least 5 seconds ahead of time to avoid the connection being (correctly) dropped by the RTSP server\n\nThis was tested with multiple video players and is an issue on all as far as I can tell currently.",
